{"v":4,"catch":"與 Daedo 的英雄「TOBOT」一起解答問答題, 擊敗邪惡的機器人吧！","desc":"與“TOBOT”用問答一起守護Daedo!\n<TOBOT:動作問答英雄>是一款結合了精彩動作和豐富常識問答的動作問答遊戲. \n\n============================\n▣ \"問答 + 動作”的刺激組合 \n▣ 與 TOBOT 一起擊敗惡棍機器人!\n▣ 科學, 歷史, 生活等多樣的常識問答\n▣ 累積積分, 與朋友一起競爭排名\n▣ 從小到大, 任何人都可以輕鬆遊玩\n============================\n\n抵抗惡棍機器人的攻擊, 通過問答擊敗它們, 成為真正的英雄吧!","publisher":"Gravity","release":"2025-05-29","genres":["益智","學習","訓練","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6eb3d4779c8cf40129a8583531b47b28f3b77a8bdc36882472efe1b2c9142b50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a92c28a7fe4420e6636df72303f68509bdfaa50feab772c8bf679522e8280395.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/791f984d76a633cb2c5e505db2e6cbff783becd3dea2f78da3816fb4b2e82866.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/96a07c19543d06b1f8b36b4c9f155b6b3584c23bb168131cf7e3f55718d5fb7f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f3ad44d9621d9ad0a8bb78ebae161be7df3557c708e61ca9f00c88004eb85ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/33ef659a6564384777e34d917a051219343f2b96de03d2aaa75075f22f10acf4.jpg"],"titleId":"010087d021298000","dlc":[]}